      "Position most patients supine when tolerated. Use a position of comfort for severe respiratory distress, left-lateral positioning during pregnancy, and the recovery position for an unconscious patient with adequate breathing.",
      "Give epinephrine 1 mg/mL 0.5 mg IM in the lateral thigh immediately for anaphylaxis. A 0.3 mg autoinjector is acceptable when it is the available device.",
